  "solution": "Ta có\n\t\t<ul><li>Đường thẳng bờ <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi><mo>:</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>6</mn></mrow></semantics></math> đi qua hai điểm <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>;</mo><mn>3</mn><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></semantics></math> và <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></semantics></math>.</li><li>Thay toạ độ điểm <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></mrow></semantics></math> vào bất phương trình <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>3</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>≥</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>6</mn></mrow></semantics></math> ta được\n\t\t\t<div class=\"math-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>⋅</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>⋅</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>≥</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>⇔</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>≥</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>6</mn><mrow><mspace width=\"0.333em\"/><mtext mathvariant=\"normal\"> (đúng)</mtext></mrow><mi>.</mi></mrow></semantics></math></div>\n\t\t\tSuy ra miền nghiệm của bất phương trình <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>3</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>≥</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>6</mn></mrow></semantics></math> là nửa mặt phẳng bờ <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mi>d</mi></semantics></math> (kể cả bờ) chứa gốc toạ độ <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mi>O</mi></semantics></math> (miền không bị gạch) trong hình vẽ dưới đây\n\t\t\t<div class=\"tex-center\"><figure class=\"tex-figure\"><img src=\"/bank-assets/fa348e742b11c993af7bd1ed969ffd4bd57c7e9d4fa25372b08146de7af1dbb7.svg\" alt=\"Hình minh họa\" loading=\"lazy\"><span class=\"figure-zoom\" aria-hidden=\"true\">⤢</span></figure></div></li></ul>",
